.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH compile 1  "compile " 
.SH NAME
compile \- Compile edge list Parquet/CSV/TSV/JSON\-L data into zero\-copy binary snapshot (.imps) or stdout stream
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcompile\fR <\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-manifest\fR> <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compile edge list Parquet/CSV/TSV/JSON\-L data into zero\-copy binary snapshot (.imps) or stdout stream
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-manifest\fR \fI<MANIFEST>\fR
Path to JSON compiler manifest file
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output binary snapshot destination path (.imps or '-' for stdout)

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
